{"title":"1999 JBMO Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_JBMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/f/15fc2ee1b7f461f0a5e4f97906439c07ad475386.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c,x,y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" /> be five real numbers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/8/678545577d29b03fd9bc41347ab217f465b81b1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3 + ax + y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/d/75d8a5453774d5cf72ef54946bccabcc2a1410d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^3 + bx + y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/e/2aeac52f5e374b6ef155f0c1b5760c94499fd2e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c^3 + cx + y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b29b358e825defa3e11b7d903d43ec31e5909a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> are all distinct numbers prove that their sum is zero.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_JBMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/5/a55679995cd6abb1efbdd15eff74eb2d3d1d0933.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"16\" /> in all three equations, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/a/0aa4e374c0d3acb0edad838aa3e137fe3e346f30.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} -y &amp;= a^3 + ax \\\\ &amp;= b^3 + bx \\\\ &amp;= c^3 + cx \\end{align*}\" width=\"105\" height=\"72\" />\nThus, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/b/0bb76cdec0db830ae9743954621ea834f8e5f5c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3 + ax = b^3 + bx = c^3 + cx$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"219\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/1/521927f8719c292d4bc1444b99dbb22eda0d8f08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3 + ax = b^3 + bx$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"139\" height=\"16\" />, rearrange and factor terms to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/7/bf7e4b3d1faca894a1e62dbbaa414b0c943cfddc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 0 &amp;= a^3 + ax - b^3 - bx \\\\ &amp;= (a-b)(a^2 + ab + b^2 + x) \\end{align*}\" width=\"226\" height=\"47\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/3/dc3c11a9c0b3b892676261e6c765abdd58cc2b51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\ne b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/c/d4c331b3e17bbda71f0dcf1bf16b3d49f5661db4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + ab + b^2 = -x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"142\" height=\"16\" />. By using the same steps, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/2/02218438b0855f33eefe1dff1e22c447a02b35e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + ac + c^2 = -x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"142\" height=\"16\" />, so by substituting and rearranging terms, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/2/792325f982b95b36c3a794d359f9d7eabd45f220.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} a^2 + ac + c^2 &amp;= a^2 + ab + b^2 \\\\ ac + c^2 &amp;= ab + b^2 \\\\ -ab + ac &amp;= b^2 - c^2 \\\\ -a(b-c) &amp;= (b+c)(b-c) \\\\ 0 &amp;= (a+b+c)(b-c) \\end{align*}\" width=\"252\" height=\"124\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/c/18cb78e5ac5ae10adb75e6af496ee5b30347454c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\ne c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"17\" />, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/5/2d501f3412e3af870e232678a6b686d3cf311fc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_JBMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_JBMO\" title=\"1999 JBMO\">1999 JBMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_JBMO_Problems\" title=\"1999 JBMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13_contests\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_JBMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1999 JBMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_JBMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1999 JBMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_JBMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1999 JBMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_JBMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1999 JBMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=JBMO_Problems_and_Solutions,_with_authors\" title=\"JBMO Problems and Solutions, with authors\"> All JBMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017193015\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 114/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 839/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 43/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3185/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.700      1 Template:JBMO_box\n100.00%    7.700      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:17441:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017193015 and revision id 105052. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}